# 3-arg form with bind and pin in a dict pattern.
# [let result] declares result as a binding target.
# Pattern: a dict with key "ok" equal to true (pinned) and key "value" bound to result.
# The scrutinee must have ok: true (pin matches) and result captures the value field.
[record: [ok: true  value: 99]]
[expected-ok: true]
[match record
  [case [let result] [ok: expected-ok  value: result] [+ result 1]]
  [case [let _] _ 0]]
=== out
Int(100)
